{"3711240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Memories", "steam_appid": 3711240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Become the <i>Lightning Slayer</i>!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hikari Shiden, a young highschool student who discovered a mysterious new world — <strong>Andogas.</strong> Take your matters into your own hands and slash through your enemies to protect the people of this world. Wield your trusty katana or unleash your special powers to show them no mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/892dd4ec3241c3be376e69baca05a830.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/892dd4ec3241c3be376e69baca05a830.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/892dd4ec3241c3be376e69baca05a830.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Protect Andogas!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andogas is caught in an ongoing war, and you are its only hope. Stand against evil, protect the innocent, and restore peace! But be warned… something darker lurks in the shadows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/a8018c7416a30bf34154508e08e1cf31.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/a8018c7416a30bf34154508e08e1cf31.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/a8018c7416a30bf34154508e08e1cf31.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich gameplay</strong> with emotional narrative and character development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action combat</strong> against many enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration </strong>and revealing hidden secrets and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced cutscenes</strong> and anime-inspired visuals for immersive storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> that sets the mood across dramatic and peaceful moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/325ab6bcaa582b2f856d56a28bd252fa.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/325ab6bcaa582b2f856d56a28bd252fa.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/325ab6bcaa582b2f856d56a28bd252fa.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Andogas is in your hands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Become the <i>Lightning Slayer</i>!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hikari Shiden, a young highschool student who discovered a mysterious new world — <strong>Andogas.</strong> Take your matters into your own hands and slash through your enemies to protect the people of this world. Wield your trusty katana or unleash your special powers to show them no mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/892dd4ec3241c3be376e69baca05a830.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/892dd4ec3241c3be376e69baca05a830.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/892dd4ec3241c3be376e69baca05a830.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Protect Andogas!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andogas is caught in an ongoing war, and you are its only hope. Stand against evil, protect the innocent, and restore peace! But be warned… something darker lurks in the shadows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/a8018c7416a30bf34154508e08e1cf31.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/a8018c7416a30bf34154508e08e1cf31.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/a8018c7416a30bf34154508e08e1cf31.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich gameplay</strong> with emotional narrative and character development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action combat</strong> against many enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration </strong>and revealing hidden secrets and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced cutscenes</strong> and anime-inspired visuals for immersive storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> that sets the mood across dramatic and peaceful moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/325ab6bcaa582b2f856d56a28bd252fa.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/325ab6bcaa582b2f856d56a28bd252fa.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/325ab6bcaa582b2f856d56a28bd252fa.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Andogas is in your hands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.poster.avif?t=1787993713\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.webm?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.mp4?t=1787993713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on an unforgettable story-driven adventure as Hikari, a young boy caught between two worlds. Uncover the mysteries of Andogas, a land threatened by war and corrupted forces. Along your journey, you'll meet allies, face powerful enemies, and make choices that shape the fate of the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/a4d4de99a2ddbe350c46f3c38dd023c0a664b3eb/header.jpg?t=1787993713", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/dd24cdd0f40